    "id": "dataset-426963",
    "name": "Belgian (Brussels) Waffles",
    "category": "Breakfast",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 10,
    "summary": "Love to cook from scratch, so when I purchased a Belgian waffle maker I searched for the perfect authentic recipe and combined a couple to come up with this. My family continuously asks for it....yummy good with strawberries and whip cream or just warm mapl...",
