    "name": "Homemade Australian Baked Beans",
    "category": "Breakfast",
    "time": "2 hr",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "Australians love their baked beans. Most homes keep a supply of the canned variety (made by Heinz). They are often eaten for breakfast, or at least as a part of breakfast. They are eaten on crusty bread.",
