    "id": "dataset-460303",
    "name": "Manu's Coddled Eggs With Spinach",
    "category": "Breakfast",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "This comes from Manu Feildel's cookbook, Manu's French Kitchen. The cooking time will vary, depending on your oven. Keep an eye on the eggs, and take them out when the cream mixture is bubbling hot, and the eggs are just set in the middle! You can add ham o...",
