    "category": "Breakfast",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 1,
    "summary": "Ok, so the title may be a little deceiving. The potatoes are only fried once, but the ingredients are in the spirit of a twice baked potato. This plate can certainly stand alone, but goes great with everything from eggs to meatloaf and anything else you wan...",
