    "category": "Breakfast",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 2,
    "summary": "Flipping an everything bagel inside out allows you to get a golden crust on the cut side, while the onion-garlic topping flavors the inside of the sandwich. We fill the sandwich with a delicious spinach omelet, melted cheddar, and crispy bacon. The game has...",
