    "summary": "This recipe for Blueberry Muffins comes from Slate's \"You're Doing It Wrong\" series, but I wonder if they are the ones doing it wrong. The resulting pastry was more dense than a muffin, and only very mildly sweet with the complementary tartness of the orang...",
