    "id": "dataset-354851",
    "name": "Gino's Granola",
    "category": "Breakfast",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "My Dad got the recipe for this granola at a Hungarian Bed & Breakfast we stayed at in Lake Tahoe. He has been making it since and it's the best granola I've ever had!I alter the recipe to use part whole grain oats for added health benefits but it does make...",
