    "category": "Lunch",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 6,
    "summary": "A great way to get your kids to eat some greens!!! My 5 year old son calls these \"peanut butter burritos\" and will easily eat a whole one all by himself. My husband and I usually double up though! :) Serve with my Thai Peanut Sauce recipe, also listed on th...",
