    "summary": "For ZWT 6. Nokkelost Cheese is what makes this quiche special. If you can't find it, and it is very hard to find, you can use a Havarti cheese with caraway. It won't be the same, because nokkelost cheese contains, caraway, cumin and cloves, but it will be a...",
