    "category": "Lunch",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 10,
    "summary": "The original recipe for this came from Better Homes & Gardens and it has been tweaked, as well. A great comfort food! ;) I have been meaning to update this recipe, for about three weeks now. UPDATE: I used reduced-fat chive & onion cream cheese (tub style),...",
