    "name": "Turkey and Vegetable Loaf",
    "category": "Lunch",
    "time": "2 hr",
    "servings": 6,
    "summary": "This impressive-looking turkey meatloaf is flavored with herbs and a layer of juicy tomatoes and zucchini. As well as the presentation, the baking method caught my attention. It's baked in a water bath to retain the moisture of the ground turkey. The recipe...",
