      "1/2 teaspoon garlic powder",
      "1/4 teaspoon crushed red pepper flakes",
      "1 1/2 cups shredded carrots",
      "1/2 cup julienned green onion",
      "12 bibb lettuce, leaves",
      "1/3 cup sliced almonds, toasted"
