    "summary": "This makes a really quick, delicious, and moist burger. The filling is subtle and does not distract from the meat. From \"The 30-Minute Kosher Cookbook\" by Judy Zeidler. You can substitute other veggies/herbs, including replacing the tomatoes with salsa for...",
