    "category": "Lunch",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 1,
    "summary": "There are so many recipes for hamburgers and we all claim 'this is the best'. Not so, I have had too many wonderful burgers but after having this one tonight I'd say it's up there with the winners. This recipe can be doubled,quadrupled, or for as many as yo...",
