    "id": "dataset-96842",
    "name": "Chicken Casserole",
    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 6,
    "summary": "There are a lot of chicken casseroles out there but this is the best I've ever had. My kids love it too. Freezes well (let thaw and then bake) and works well for a covered dish meal. I like to serve it with cranberry sauce on the side. And as a reviewer sug...",
