    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "I'm posting this as requested. This is something I make for my family. It is very versatile; use ground beef, roast or my favorite; shredded chicken. I love to use the Velveeta in mine. It gives it a richer flavor. It is one of the many dishes I learned to...",
