    "name": "Mexican Grilled Hamburgers",
    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 8,
    "summary": "When making Hamburgers for the boys, I make mine a little different adding extra zing and spice. I also like to place my burger in a flour tortilla and grilled a little longer to let the cheese melt. YUM, my favorite way to eat a hamburger.... like a taco....",
