    "servings": 8,
    "summary": "Taken from Wholefoodsmarket .com and posted for ZWT. \"This Honduran staple, known as \"pan de coco,\" is like a plump dinner roll. It's delicious served alongside a meal of rice, beans and fried plantains. Or enjoy a roll simply with a cup of coffee in the mo...",
