      "1/2 cup cornmeal",
      "1/4 cup all-purpose flour",
      "1 egg white",
      "1/2-1 cup cheese (cheddar, colby jack, whatever you like... I use cheddar)",
      "3 -4 tablespoons milk (more or less for moisture)",
