    "id": "dataset-503325",
    "name": "Chiles Rellenos",
    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "2 hr",
    "servings": 8,
    "summary": "Wow. Wow. Wow. Wow. That pretty much sums up how much I loved this recipe. I made it for breakfast, and it was like a souffle but cheesier and with a bite of green chilies. Recipe courtesy of Favorite's From Cole's Church, Cole Community Church, Boise Idaho...",
