    "servings": 8,
    "summary": "Rotisserie style chicken is spit roasted chicken using a rotisserie. Even roasting, a moister bird and having the fat drip off during the rotation are the reasons why rotisserie chicken is so popular. The problem is that not every one has a rotisserie at ho...",
