    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "Kids will go crazy for these fun nibbles. Have fun in the kitchen - your little ones will love helping you make these tasty star-shaped crisp bites. TIP – Feel free to express your creativity in the kitchen with all sorts of leftover combinations for altern...",
