    "name": "Pork and Mushroom Casserole",
    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 3,
    "summary": "This is a very old recipe that I found years ago in one of my mother's cookbooks that she got when she first got married. It is very delicious and a favorite in my household.",
