    "id": "dataset-121206",
    "name": "Use It up Casserole",
    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 8,
    "summary": "Here is a old recipe I received from a friend a long time ago. It is the kind of casserole that helps you use up your last nights dinner.",
