    "summary": "From the October 2012 issue of Woman's Day magazine. This recipe also included Tips & Techniques: Switch It Up: Substitute 1 1/2 pounds boneless pork loin for the chicken. Use Up The Ingredient: Make a quick baked potato topping: Combine 1/2 cup sour cream,...",
