    "summary": "Typically, Palaver Sauce includes fresh beef, smoked pork or fish, and dark green leaves. In West Africa, these leaves might be \"platto\", \"bologi,\" or bitter leaf. A good substitute is spinach. African natives coined \"palaver\" in the 19th century when Europ...",
