    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "I love enchiladas, but making them with shredded cheese is so messy I avoided them. Then I realized a Mexican restaurant I loved made their enchiladas from a cheese that tasted like Velveeta. I was inspired. My family loves these and I have to make a LOT wh...",
