    "summary": "A recipe I found on www.nomenu,com by: From A Past Edition OfThe New Orleans Menu Daily, By Tom Fitzmorris. Here is what is stated about the recipe: A classic from another generation of diners (those of the immediate post-war era), this luscious beef dish i...",
