    "id": "dataset-265728",
    "name": "Chef's Catalog World's Greatest Meatloaf",
    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "2 hr",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "Found on www.chefscatalog.com. DH adores this meatloaf. Since I seldom have fresh herbs on hand, I used 2 tablespoons of the squeeze Italian herbs from a tube instead of dried herbs.",
