    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 8,
    "summary": "For me, there is nothing quite as good as a meal cooked on the grill. This recipe calls for boneless pork....tenderloin of course is the leanest, but feel free to use what you have on hand. I tend to grab whatever my grocery store has on special. :) Make a...",
