    "instructions": "Slice off the tops of the bread loaves and hollow them out.\nUse the loose bread to feed the birds tomorrow.\nCombine the turkey and the onion soup mix thoroughly.\nForm them into patties that will fit into the hollow bread.\nSautee them.\nLayer the bottoms of the bread loaves with the cubed cheese.\nPut a meat patty on top of the cheese in the loaves.\nPour chile into the bread bowls up to about an inch from the top.\nCover the chile with mashed potatoes.\nBake according to instructions on the wrapper the bread came in.\nDust top with paprika and scatter some jalapenos on it.\nServe with a green salad.\nNo side dish.\nThis is a whole gang of food!",
