    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "Posting for ZWT6 North Africa/Middle East region. From www.turkishfoodandrecipes.com As mentioned on the recipe \"White Beans with Meat is a very traditional and common dish in Turkey, especially when it is served with pilaf and pickles.\"",
