    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "45 min",
    "servings": 6,
    "summary": "I harvested a beautiful head of cabbage from the garden and was in the mood for cabbage rolls. After looking over some recipes, I decided to use what I had on hand. The results were amazing!",
