    "instructions": "Place Roast in crockpot.\nMix 2 packets of italian dressing mix with one cup of water and pour over roast.\nMix 2 packets of brown gravy mix with one cup of water and pour over roast.\nCook on low for 8 hours or until roast shreds easy with a fork.\nIf desired, add sliced onion to crockpot during last hour of cooking.\nShred with 2 forks and serve on toasted buns with cheese.\nLeftovers can be frozen.",
