    "id": "dataset-237360",
    "name": "Broccoli Ham Stroganoff",
    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "With Easter coming I've been looking through my recipes for ham recipes for those ham leftovers and came across this one.",
