    "id": "dataset-187486",
    "name": "Tinga",
    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "2 hr",
    "servings": 12,
    "summary": "The heat can be adjusted to your own taste by adding or cutting down on the chipotle peppers. It works well for a buffet, and is even more flavorful the next day.",
