    "id": "dataset-308490",
    "name": "Honey-Orange Glazed Chicken",
    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "Good dish to please people with. DH loves it, friends & family love it, finally getting around to posting. There are several recipes for Orange Glazed Chicken out there, but this one uses the chicken in bite-size pieces like you would get at a Chinese resta...",
