    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 10,
    "summary": "Do you ever go to Mexican food restaurants to order enchiladas, and get back a greasy mess that doesn't look as good as it sounded? Or do you ever wish they stuck some veggies in them instead of just meat? Well, I do, so I made this recipe. In my opinion, i...",
