    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "A long day at the hospital and I come home to a package of boneless skinless chicken breasts needing to be used. I decided to make a different version of the old standard. This was given a thumbs up by my family and was told I \"could\" make this again.",
