    "id": "dataset-130312",
    "name": "Shiitake Mushroom and Noodle Stir Fry",
    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "Look out for black bean paste in oriental store. If you cant get a hold of it you can use black bean sauce. Pak choy is sold in large supermarkets and has a wonderful tender green leaf and a crisp stalk. Use bok choy or baby spinach leaves as an alternative.",
