    "id": "dataset-128819",
    "name": "Barbacoa",
    "category": "Dinner",
    "time": "45 min",
    "servings": 2,
    "summary": "This is the way my dad makes barbacoa when he doesn't have time to make it the traditional way. I'm posting the recipe so that I don't lose it... (again)",
