    "name": "Eddy Whole Wheat Pancakes",
    "category": "Dessert",
    "time": "15 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "This is a recipe I developed wanting a light fluffy but great tasting whole wheat pancake. I hope you like it too.",
