    "category": "Dessert",
    "time": "2 hr",
    "servings": 18,
    "summary": "My mother-in-law was the best cook in the world. She died at age 92 in 2000, but this recipe came from one of her early friends in Winters, TX, before 1943. I bake it in her large tube pan that is 11 1/2\" diameter, 4\" deep, very heavy steel. It makes a very...",
