    "name": "The Perfect White Chocolate-Oatmeal Cookies",
    "category": "Dessert",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 12,
    "summary": "This recipe came from Sunny Anderson on foodnetwork.com They are sooo good, they originaly were peaches and cream cookies, but i've found that they don't taste very good with the dried peaches in them.",
