    "name": "Chocolate Peanut Butter Streusel Cake",
    "category": "Dessert",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 12,
    "summary": "This is truly a miracle cake recipe! My dad does not like peanut butter, but would eat this cake! 8) Enjoy!",
