    "category": "Dessert",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 6,
    "summary": "i first had this at an aunts, demanded the recipe & have been making it ever since! everyone who's tasted it has loved it! looks great and and only takes about half an hour to make! PREPARATION TIME DOES NOT INCLUDE CHILLING TIME!",
