    "instructions": "whisk the eggs until light & fluffy.\nadd the margarine and whisk together.\nthen add the sugar, flour, salt & baking powder & whisk mixture together until it has a smooth texture.\npreheat the oven to 180 Degrees Celsius.\ngenerously grease a 20x25 cm baking tray.\npour in the cake mixture and place in the middle of the oven for approximately 15-20 minutes (until a skewer comes out clean).\nremove the cake from the baking tray whilst hot & place on a high sided serving tray\nimmediately pour the condensed milk evenly over the cake - it will soak it up.\nleave to cool.\nin a clean bowl, whip the cream until it holds its shape.\nthen spread the whipped cream over the cool cake & top with little flakes of chocolate.\nput in the fridge to cool for at least 45 minutes & serve cold.",
