    "summary": "A good old English Recipe, ideal for those who are not keen on the rich, bitty darl traditional Christmas Cake.This was a first time for me, so I went for a lighter, more golden and less bitty but fruity Christmas Cake recipe from my nan, who is enjoying Ch...",
