    "id": "dataset-360365",
    "name": "Stephanie's Wicked Chocolate Chip Cookies",
    "category": "Dessert",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 6,
    "summary": "I made these for my husband when we were dating. He had recently lost over a 100lbs....these cookies were his downfall. He was the one who called them \"wicked\" and the name stuck. I have a SIL who asks for these at every family gathering and for Christmas....",
