    "summary": "I found this recipe from the book \"Crazy about Cookies\" by Krystina Castella. I have yet to try this recipe however; it's at the top of my to bake list. I found it hard to find blueberry jam but, was able to locate it at Fred Meyer/Kroger it was one of thei...",
