    "id": "dataset-322695",
    "name": "Old Fashioned Devil's Food Cake (Cake Mix Doctor)",
    "category": "Dessert",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 16,
    "summary": "This cake is delicious but truly it is \"the icing on the cake\" that makes it. Use the \"Perfect Chocolate Frosting\" and this cake will be perfect. Both the cake and icing recipes are from the Cake Mix Doctor cookbook.",
