    "id": "dataset-278944",
    "name": "Cherry Angel Food Trifle",
    "category": "Dessert",
    "time": "45 min",
    "servings": 12,
    "summary": "From Quick Cooking 2001 recipeLight and refreshing dessert. Very pretty in a trifle bowl. Leave time for trifle to chill for at least 4 hours before serving. Note: Not sure of the size of a normal envelope of dry whipped topping mix - just the standard size...",
