    "name": "Chocolate Bread Pudding",
    "category": "Dessert",
    "time": "2 hr",
    "servings": 10,
    "summary": "This recipe is dangerous it causes severe Chocolate Swoon!!! I have made it with french bread and with challah, both are superb! Don't attempt this if you are on a diet!",
