    "category": "Dessert",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 6,
    "summary": "this was taken from Gennaro Cataldo from Good Food Bites.It is sooooo goood.This is the best way to use up unwanted panettone.It is best if left overnight in the fridge.",
