    "id": "dataset-465965",
    "name": "Apple Rings With Cinnamon Cream Sauce",
    "category": "Dessert",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 16,
    "summary": "This was a recipe winner for apple themed recipes over at betterrecipes.com. It's very different from any other apple dessert I've ever tried.",
