    "id": "dataset-54337",
    "name": "Easy Crystal Light Lemon Pie",
    "category": "Dessert",
    "time": "2 hr",
    "servings": 8,
    "summary": "A light & fluffy sweet/tart lemon pie that has half the sugar of regular pies, because Crystal Light lemonade mix contains aspartame sweetener (like Equal). Covered with plastic wrap, this keeps well for several days in the refrigerator. Baking time include...",
