    "time": "2 hr",
    "servings": 1,
    "summary": "I just wanted to put this in my cookbook because I didn't want to loose it. I found it online.Chocolate Stout CakeAdapted from Bon Appétit, September 2002, recipe originally from the Barrington Brewery in Great Barrington, MAThis recipe was originally inten...",
