    "id": "dataset-277471",
    "name": "Creamy Red Pepper Crostini",
    "category": "Snack",
    "time": "15 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "This is a crowd pleaser!Toasted Baguette Slices topped with Cream Cheese, Roasted Red Peppers, Parmesan Cheese and a Lemon twist... Yum!I use jarred Roasted Red Peppers that are already seeded and peeled, but you can make your own.Enjoy!",
