    "id": "dataset-534638",
    "name": "Uova Alla Diavola Calabresi from APERITIVO",
    "category": "Snack",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 1,
    "summary": "Calabrian deviled eggs ||| Text excerpted from APERITIVO © 2017 by Kay Plunkett-Hogge ||| As mentioned earlier, the Calabrians are the kings and queens of Italian chillies. So it made perfect sense in my chilli-fevered imagination to make a devilled egg wit...",
