    "category": "Snack",
    "time": "2 hr",
    "servings": 1,
    "summary": "This is an adopted recipe that I've not yet had the chance to try, although it looks wonderful. Any reviews by those who make this recipe before I do (or after, of course) would be appreciated. Thanks!",
