    "id": "dataset-325769",
    "name": "Buffalo Chicken Fingers/ Tenders",
    "category": "Snack",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 6,
    "summary": "This is a recipe from Silvana Nardone from the Oct 2008 Everyday with Rachael Ray magazine. It is buffalo wings without the bones. Easy to prepare but more than 15 minutes prep time stated. I served it with crudetes and ranch dip which could be used to dunk...",
