    "id": "dataset-416919",
    "name": "French Onion Soup from Cook's (Cooks) the New Best Recipes",
    "category": "Soup",
    "time": "2 hr",
    "servings": 6,
    "summary": "A pretty easy version I found was doubly rewarding by using homemade broths/stocks, which isn't necessary, but I opted for them. Apparently, Cook's Illustrated has TWO versions of French Onion Soup and I didn't see this one posted. We really enjoyed this; i...",
