      "8 cups reduced-sodium vegetable broth (or chicken broth)",
      "1 1/2 cups red lentils, rinsed (see Tip)",
      "1/3 cup bulgur",
      "2 tablespoons tomato paste",
      "1 bay leaf",
      "3 tablespoons lemon juice",
      "fresh ground black pepper, to taste",
      "1 teaspoon paprika",
