    "name": "Pumpkin and Yellow Split Pea Soup",
    "category": "Soup",
    "time": "2 hr",
    "servings": 12,
    "summary": "Food and Wine, from their 2007 Thanksgiving in your 20s Menu: \"In her reimagining of holiday pumpkin soup, F&W's Melissa Rubel adds pumpkin to dal - the spicy, soupy Indian legume dish. The result is a hearty, healthy soup with a lovely edge of sweetness.\"",
