    "name": "Molasses-Cider Coleslaw",
    "category": "Salad",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 8,
    "summary": "The dressing for this coleslaw sounds so delicious that I had to post the recipe. This salad is wonderful with bbq brisket or ribs. This is a Williams-Sonoma recipe.",
