    "id": "dataset-420829",
    "name": "Spinach Salad",
    "category": "Salad",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "Spinach salad with egg and bacon. Fresh and tasty, serve as a side dish with grilled chicken, or as a light meal.The dressing is tastiest when mixted ahead of time and allowed to sit over night, but in a rush I slit the garlic several times to allow it to f...",
