    "category": "Pasta",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "This rice dish is absolutely delicious, I have made it quite a few times and my family just goes wild over it! Prep time does not include pre-boiling the long grain and wild rice. I have even added in chopped jalapenos. If you cannot find uncooked long grai...",
