    "summary": "This is a low carb version of Rachel Ray's Mexican Lasagna. Depending on ingredients, each serving is approximately 12 net carbs.Original recipe found here http://www.foodnetwork.com/recipes/rachael-ray/mexican-lasagna-recipe/index.html",
