    "summary": "A delicious, healthy, moist, nutty, and filling pancake recipe from \"Bon Appétit Magazine\" (Jan. 2004). You can tweak this recipe to your preferences, it's very forgiving. You can add some cinnamon to the batter, throw in some blueberries, mash in a banana,...",
