    "summary": "from the America's Test Kitchen Episode: Italian Bread and SauceThis full-flavored tomato sauce takes only 15 minutes to prepare. High-quality canned tomatoes will make a big difference in this sauce. Our preferred brands of crushed tomatoes are Tuttorosso...",
