    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 3,
    "summary": "A delicious pasta with plenty of veggies and chicken. Fit for 3-4 people. I tried this at a restaurant here, and was determined to mimic it at home--it is REALLY simple to put together and is a fabulous meal.",
