    "name": "Yum Yum Sweet and Sour Shrimp En Papillote (In Parchment)",
    "category": "Seafood",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 6,
    "summary": "Delicious and simple, this recipe is good enough for company, yet easy enough for a quick, everyday meal. I like serving this right in the parchment -- just carefully cut the tops open and peel back the paper a bit. This recipe goes nicely with rice or cous...",
