    "id": "dataset-435195",
    "name": "Tilapia With Lemon Butter Sauce",
    "category": "Seafood",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "Easy, quick and inexpensive; fairly healthy as long as you don't go overboard on the butter - you can half the amount of butter or replace with Smart Balance or the like to cut down on the sat fat and still get the same flavor. I prefer Andy's fish fry, but...",
