    "name": "Salmon With Polenta",
    "category": "Seafood",
    "time": "2 hr",
    "servings": 6,
    "summary": "I found this recipe in the back of a May 2009 issue of Reader's Digest and made it for dinner last night and it was wonderful! The polenta and tomato sauce give the salmon a definite Mediterrean feel.I didn't have any Italian seasoning, so I substituted 1/2...",
