    "category": "Vegetarian",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 1,
    "summary": "I found this recipe while wine tasting in Napa Valley. These are so good and simple to make. There's nothing like freshly baked goods :) Prep time does not include 24 hours to chill the dough. Enjoy!",
