    "summary": "This is a popular side dish, typically served with sandwiches, at various Neiman Marcus restaurants. It also makes a great corn salsa with a little less sugar, but a finely chopped jalapeno and/or a dash of tapatio sauce added to the relish.Recipe from Neim...",
