    "name": "Quick Corn Muffins (From Scratch)",
    "category": "Vegetarian",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 1,
    "summary": "I adapted this recipe borrowing a recommendation from a reviewer on the Family Fun site. She prepared the batter substituting three quarter cup of cake flour for all purpose. She also substituted one quarter cup honey for granulated. Because I was baking th...",
