    "category": "Vegetarian",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "Eggplant cutlets make a healthy vegetarian entree that can be sliced and chewed just like meat, so it's a popular option for those new to vegetarian eating. In this recipe, thick eggplant slices are baked in the oven in a flavorful marinade. This eggplant r...",
