    "id": "dataset-253427",
    "name": "Florence's W W II Asparagus on Toast",
    "category": "Vegetarian",
    "time": "30 min",
    "servings": 2,
    "summary": "This is a nostalgia recipe that my mom used to make during the World War II days of the 40's. I still make it , but with an update or two. I use fresh asparagus instead of canned. And may add a finely chopped hard boiled egg sprinkled over the asparagus jus...",
