    "id": "dataset-471087",
    "name": "Nif's Caramelized Onions for a Crowd",
    "category": "Side",
    "time": "2 hr",
    "servings": 1,
    "summary": "Tonight my Dad made an amazing Prime Rib Roast for New Year's Dinner. I wanted to make something to have with it! The whole family seemed to really like it and enjoyed the roast with these onions and some great horseradish. Although this dish takes time to...",
