    "summary": "From America's Test Kitchen. This looks just wonderful. \"To prepare the asparagus for this salad, we found that broiling concentrates the flavor of the asparagus and lightly caramelizes the peel. We prefer to use thin (under 5/8-inch) asparagus under the br...",
