    "id": "dataset-408756",
    "name": "Jazzed up Citrusy Beets",
    "category": "Side",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 4,
    "summary": "Beets are good for us - full of Vitamin C, folate, potassium and fiber. But if you are like me, you hardly ever eat them! The orange flavour in these beets is a fun twist to a vegetable that doesn't deserve the faces made at the thought of eating them",
