    "summary": "Wanted to serve up a pearl couscous for my Casablanca Girls Martini night. Could not find a good one on here so found this on Cookstr.*When I made this, I only used 1 1/2 cups broth as I did not want it stewy...I wanted it more like a side dish...turned out...",
