    "summary": "This recipe is based on one from Mother Earth News, Wiser Living Series, Fall 2011. Sauerkraut provides up to 25% of the recommended daily allowance of vitamin C. Also, as a live-culture food, it contains lactobacilli, beneficial bacteria that promote diges...",
