    "name": "Vidalia Onion-Cranberry Relish",
    "category": "Side",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 12,
    "summary": "I made this the first time when I hosted Thanksgiving at my home for my family (deviating from the \"ordinary\" cranberry sauce.) Since then I've been asked to make this relish for Christmas, Easter, and any other holiday that involves a Turkey. Yummy, yummy....",
