    "id": "dataset-345381",
    "name": "Cristina Ferrare's Creamed Spinach",
    "category": "Side",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 6,
    "summary": "Very easy and versatile recipe that was highlighted on the Oprah television show. I added mustard for a little kick, but perhaps hot sauce would work as well.",
