    "id": "dataset-337378",
    "name": "Cheesy Bacon Thanksgiving Green Bean Casserole!",
    "category": "Side",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 8,
    "summary": "So this one I don't think of the calories since I make it once a year. My family is known to hate Green Bean Casserole however when I created this recipe no one could believe how good it is with crisp bacon and melted cheese this one is a keeper.Don't expec...",
