    "id": "dataset-315276",
    "name": "Creamy String Beans and Mushrooms",
    "category": "Side",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 2,
    "summary": "I thoroughly enjoy young, fresh string beans. They are best when used within 3 to 7 days after picking, but best when freshly picked.I also love mushrooms and combined them with the string beans to make a tasty meal combination.Many years ago, we grew diffe...",
