    "id": "dataset-86109",
    "name": "Garlic Smashed Potatoes",
    "category": "Side",
    "time": "60 min",
    "servings": 8,
    "summary": "This double-cooking technique (boiling, then roasting) works very well with whole red potatoes. The finished potatoes are rough and crisp and very good.",
