    "summary": "GOOD MORNING AMERICA'S 2007 TOP DRESSING/STUFFING RECIPE - Submitted by Hollie Dorethy of Sachse, Texas: Well, I am a very Southern Texas girl who married into a rather large Italian family. After the first family gathering at Thanksgiving, I decided the ne...",
